( ATARI-850  DOWNLOAD )
BASE @ HEX
CODE DO-SIO
  XSAVE STX, 0 # LDA,   E459 JSR,
  XSAVE LDX,   NEXT JMP,
: SET-DCB   50 300 C!  1 301 C!  3F 302 C! 40 303 C! 500 304 !
  5 306 C!  0 307 C!  C 308 C!  0 309 ! 0 30B C! ;

CODE RELOCATE  XSAVE STX, 506 JSR, HERE 8 + JSR,  XSAVE LDX,
  NEXT JMP,  0C JMP(),

 : BOOT850    HERE 2E7 !  SET-DCB  DO-SIO
500 300 0C CMOVE DO-SIO RELOCATE
2E7 @ HERE - ALLOT HERE FENCE ! ;
BASE ! ;S

